cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CiSS Financial – Circular Sustainability Scorecard for the Financial Sector"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wellingtonporto-dot/ciss-financeiro-circular-sustainability-scorecard"
abstract: >-
  Algorithm and data for measuring circular sustainability in financial
  institutions. The CiSS (Circular Sustainability Scorecard) measures the
  balance among economic-financial, socio-environmental and governance
  dimensions through the Lorenz curve and the Gini coefficient, with
  polarity-adjusted ratio-to-mean normalization. Includes an illustrative
  application to Banco da Amazônia, 2021–2024.
keywords:
  - circular sustainability
  - sustainable finance
  - development banks
  - Gini coefficient
  - Sustainable Balanced Scorecard
  - Amazon
